duct/decus-60_DEC60"}],"summary":"","variants":{"finishes":[{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Decus-Freestanding-Bath_dec007-mw","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-dec007-mw","label":"Matte White"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Decus-Freestanding-Bath---Satin-White_dec007-sgw","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-dec007-sgw","label":"Satin White"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div>Defined by its soft chamfer base that gracefully meets the floor, the Decus Bath is a marvel of refined architectural edges and inspired simplicity. Drawing from simple geometric shapes, it carries an air of softness in its overall aesthetic, thanks to the harmonious angles and chamfer base. Available in both matte white and semi-gloss white, Decus is meticulously crafted from stone composite solid surface. It not only presents a luxurious tactile experience but also quickly warms to the touch while effectively maintaining heat. Embrace the art of modern bathing with the Decus Bath, where elegance meets innovation.<br/></div><div><div><b>Made with MarmoTech</b></div><div>Constructed from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.</div></div><div>Notes:</div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included</div><div>-Available in Semi Gloss White and Matte White</div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-sgw\"><b>SBW009/SGW</b></a></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
